  "version": "1",
  "questId": "fr_08",
  "lang": "ru",
  "lines": [
    {
      "key": "000fc05",
      "nodeTitle": "item_hat",
      "sourceText": "В шапке голова не замерзнет.",
      "sourceEnText": "With a hat, your head won't get cold.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_000fc05.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:28Z",
      "textHash": "e1c6b1093df7c6567c10670a3ede542a86cc34b103ae899e1c890fc28e60b3a4"
    },
    {
      "key": "001e940",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base4",
      "sourceText": "Ответьте на три вопроса о горе.",
      "sourceEnText": "Answer three questions about the mountain.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_001e940.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2011,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:04Z",
      "textHash": "15a05d9d94e614f2506106d72d62f61157e73405ca2a18f8d2d4fde367560e04"
    },
    {
      "key": "003e87c",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_bonus",
      "sourceText": "Вот вам тёплый шарф! Берите!",
      "sourceEnText": "Here's a nice warm scarf! Take it!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_003e87c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2011,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:29Z",
      "textHash": "dae29ee04a1cf44c983ea0b5f213209068f9591ab2f24a9dd6801938bf25fca5"
    },
    {
      "key": "003ecb2",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "Монблан — самая высокая гора во Франции.",
      "sourceEnText": "Mont Blanc is the highest mountain in France.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_003ecb2.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 3788,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:33Z",
      "textHash": "31cf8bcb682d0b51c2879cdd017557f1e8ffc3ac99f56993e91930878d0e8e16"
    },
    {
      "key": "00a7e83",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "Точный ! ",
      "sourceEnText": "Exact ! ",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_00a7e83.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 862,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:53Z",
      "textHash": "c6a51dd6a9c6e4be98205363468b667179a257143722948f68185a00326edfba"
    },
    {
      "key": "011dc7e",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "Я люблю горы. А вы?",
      "sourceEnText": "I love the mountains. And you?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_011dc7e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 1724,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:31Z",
      "textHash": "8e33b5b8b19b09d3dfedddd83a6d04ff068c1c6431ff885ba4a0327e2f808d5c"
    },
    {
      "key": "015bf8a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base1",
      "sourceText": "Теперь вы готовы. Вы можете подняться на вершину Монблана!",
      "sourceEnText": "Now you're ready. You can go to the summit of Mont Blanc!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_015bf8a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4101,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:16Z",
      "textHash": "0187b96e879ae6cd8f3de12fd8d8619a3cd9c5ebf56fda8767b31cafe6fe064f"
    },
    {
      "key": "018880a",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base4",
      "sourceText": "Высота вершины Монблана составляет 4807 метров.",
      "sourceEnText": "The summit of Mont Blanc is 4807 meters high.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_018880a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4023,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:02Z",
      "textHash": "d9d6dbeb8f6710ece05bd87a506d2f3a48cd3d0296785c5da37ee8e5bea974a7"
    },
    {
      "key": "01a4b20",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "пальмовые листья",
      "sourceEnText": "palm fronds",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_01a4b20.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1176,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:55Z",
      "textHash": "7207dee8b5d4dbdbcd7556a879d6958b5c50384b3adfc02440b456b7dca65b20"
    },
    {
      "key": "01beb5e",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Собака ушла в горы вместе с вашими вещами.",
      "sourceEnText": "The dog went up into the mountains with your things.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_01beb5e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2795,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:03Z",
      "textHash": "d46a7c22a9f7df9022eba8a3e446ff112f4ddf6da1513469f3cdd62113b63f6e"
    },
    {
      "key": "01e5f66",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_hiker",
      "sourceText": "Вы когда-нибудь лепили снеговика?",
      "sourceEnText": "Have you ever made a snowman?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_01e5f66.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 2064,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:44Z",
      "textHash": "7623b4d6d3bd65dc17a7ef8585a9ddff9095cfbc596bdb0a87c8e66d247af049"
    },
    {
      "key": "029a03e",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base2",
      "sourceText": "Солнце и снег вредят глазам. Вам нужны солнцезащитные очки.",
      "sourceEnText": "The sun and snow hurt your eyes. You need sunglasses.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_029a03e.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4232,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:35Z",
      "textHash": "80234f941cba64c2b38f152536d310d93eca145f386570833beb14e9b047cf64"
    },
    {
      "key": "029f39c",
      "nodeTitle": "item_backpack",
      "sourceText": "Теперь отправляйтесь в горы. Найдите теплую одежду и горное снаряжение.",
      "sourceEnText": "Now go to the mountains. Find warm clothes and mountain gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_029f39c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4624,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:14Z",
      "textHash": "d5ecf84c44c1a2bcbae4e1cd9437b1363cbb1c5874d9cae30f39e32cf7fd2c06"
    },
    {
      "key": "02a2ea9",
      "nodeTitle": "item_sunglasses",
      "sourceText": "В горах солнце и снег слепят глаза.",
      "sourceEnText": "In the mountains, the sun and snow hurt the eyes",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_02a2ea9.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:46Z",
      "textHash": "067711ebbc4d3f9732065d2aa49f5e038edeae61d31d837543ccad1ffff417ef"
    },
    {
      "key": "02a3874",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman_1",
      "sourceText": "Нет, спасибо, я останусь здесь.",
      "sourceEnText": "No thanks, I'll stay here.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_02a3874.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2116,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:22Z",
      "textHash": "09771c5c236cc5db0269c3f48b9f0b031b62c096e6e6e96e54d9abfc78f99d62"
    },
    {
      "key": "02c9805",
      "nodeTitle": "activity_3_done",
      "sourceText": "Откройте сундук, чтобы достать кошки!",
      "sourceEnText": "Open the chest to get crampons!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_02c9805.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2116,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:40:09Z",
      "textHash": "0116f349462939e82850e716b180e94d24cb6d97d6faa21ac2ba4e83e99b92c7"
    },
    {
      "key": "030fa1c",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base4",
      "sourceText": "Отлично! Вы покорили вершину Монблана.",
      "sourceEnText": "Well done! You've reached the summit of Mont Blanc.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_030fa1c.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3135,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:01Z",
      "textHash": "fc9acb9d4948f9e76cb834fb5ea27c71a774875485901f9ae390099aa2187e40"
    },
    {
      "key": "035e68a",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman",
      "sourceText": "Базовый лагерь 4",
      "sourceEnText": "Basecamp 4",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_035e68a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1228,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:40:30Z",
      "textHash": "3b4e61185d6718f6f796409cb35c4b2e7909732edcf79f7a0e18cba754640af8"
    },
    {
      "key": "0371d31",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_alps_climber",
      "sourceText": "С вами может пойти горный проводник.",
      "sourceEnText": "A mountain guide can come with you.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0371d31.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2377,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:48Z",
      "textHash": "020ae61d8d06a10df501c9facf1d01014b64223d619649d3c8f862becf73b55f"
    },
    {
      "key": "038d1bc",
      "nodeTitle": "item_rope",
      "sourceText": "Веревка обеспечивает безопасность на льду и камнях.",
      "sourceEnText": "The rope allows you to be safe on ice and rocks.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_038d1bc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3631,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:59Z",
      "textHash": "8700911eb1302c17efa85e4e07d8ab262d47cb83f99e19cab4566d9601776339"
    },
    {
      "key": "03db010",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_swiss",
      "sourceText": "Швейцария расположена к северу от Монблана.",
      "sourceEnText": "Switzerland is north of Mont Blanc.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_03db010.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2534,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T16:42:21Z",
      "textHash": "0eeeec9baef0e1b2e0eeda9e1c5c856372b2f95e299bc4089c0611f26730d73e"
    },
    {
      "key": "03dd802",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base1",
      "sourceText": "У тебя нет пальто. Иди и найди его!",
      "sourceEnText": "You don't have a coat. Go find it!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_03dd802.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2612,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:19Z",
      "textHash": "6261999505ef65f90ebfae616dd9fe6f24941021b44785c02ab5e59fd0faded9"
    },
    {
      "key": "045409f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Во-первых, вам понадобится рюкзак.",
      "sourceEnText": "First, you need a backpack.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_045409f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2194,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:07Z",
      "textHash": "ca5fd3c042b37c185359236c04969ce76beacc0ab6e3c92f9fb7111199b97ef0"
    },
    {
      "key": "046eb33",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Вернитесь, когда найдете его.",
      "sourceEnText": "Come back when you've found it.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_046eb33.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2011,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:00Z",
      "textHash": "7c47ba85459fa4dd8b2e333c2686fa7d8dfad19efc8e13857f84ca20af88c7bc"
    },
    {
      "key": "04bbada",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "Присмотритесь! Вы увидите сурка.",
      "sourceEnText": "Look closely! You're going to see a marmot.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_04bbada.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 2351,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:35Z",
      "textHash": "1ff04327b892d0a4f2518df365ecb88bdfb29367dbb27afa58714bca6c6e1618"
    },
    {
      "key": "04c1c1f",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "У вас есть рюкзак. Теперь идите за тёплой одеждой и горным снаряжением.",
      "sourceEnText": "You have your backpack. Now go get your warm clothes and mountain gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_04c1c1f.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5224,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:02:56Z",
      "textHash": "de3095f8fdeac4e3098480bab0aad4fcf8d400263d3fd3a29586e1c47046d08e"
    },
    {
      "key": "050fe70",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_italy",
      "sourceText": "Италия расположена к востоку от Монблана.",
      "sourceEnText": "Italy is east of Mont Blanc.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_050fe70.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2429,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T16:42:20Z",
      "textHash": "8edbd1404db1cfaf106ed1d2cab978962e442acb5f23f8d65b6836ad7c726016"
    },
    {
      "key": "0557ef5",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_hiker",
      "sourceText": "В горах лежит снег.",
      "sourceEnText": "There is snow in the mountains.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0557ef5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_M",
      "durationMs": 1541,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:41Z",
      "textHash": "5b35151476ed3e4e80f8efb3d901e3adfa8df4944deec6c8e4653de02fd660ec"
    },
    {
      "key": "056ec2b",
      "nodeTitle": "chest_base1",
      "sourceText": "Сундук открывается! Внутри находится некоторое снаряжение.",
      "sourceEnText": "The chest opens! It contains some equipment.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_056ec2b.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 4153,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:25Z",
      "textHash": "99decb6afa444a8f184df5f9177be3038ca888ab843deeac022a507f2745bb70"
    },
    {
      "key": "058bb65",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman",
      "sourceText": "Базовый лагерь 3",
      "sourceEnText": "Basecamp 3",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_058bb65.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1176,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:40:29Z",
      "textHash": "30279bdee46e5093ea5795983a2efc4cdb5ece8c5cecbc0514b31616a55fbec3"
    },
    {
      "key": "0590129",
      "nodeTitle": "spawned_tourist",
      "sourceText": "Чтобы подняться на вершину Монблана, возьмите с собой теплую одежду.",
      "sourceEnText": "To go to the summit of Mont Blanc, take warm clothes.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0590129.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "ADULT_F",
      "durationMs": 4101,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:36Z",
      "textHash": "d3b117d633f81426928e3a53d8e7610140145057f03d5ce020485a686bac2fcc"
    },
    {
      "key": "059d744",
      "nodeTitle": "item_hat",
      "sourceText": "Шляпа защитит вас от ветра.",
      "sourceEnText": "The hat protects you from the wind.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_059d744.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1959,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:29Z",
      "textHash": "abba3e6e6278efeae62e8c9397fbdfb5d260cb65cc32bc4ca012fcdc965fe068"
    },
    {
      "key": "05cabb5",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Откройте сундук, и вы найдете рюкзак!",
      "sourceEnText": "Open the chest to find the backpack!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_05cabb5.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2560,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:08Z",
      "textHash": "fec6e7a0acbe6b1a41b2776eee61095d5adb3c6cf12aa2a64de0d7350d4f86be"
    },
    {
      "key": "05e3658",
      "nodeTitle": "snowman",
      "sourceText": "Базовый лагерь 2",
      "sourceEnText": "Basecamp 2",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_05e3658.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1123,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:40:29Z",
      "textHash": "086b3c976e1f18d0afe0345b4c40ebadc650d5bb142d2e8602f6295794f25275"
    },
    {
      "key": "05e80cb",
      "nodeTitle": "item_backpack",
      "sourceText": "В рюкзаке находятся вода, еда и карта.",
      "sourceEnText": "In the backpack, there is water, food, and a map.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_05e80cb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2717,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:13Z",
      "textHash": "76fe9e2d774f4cea4b16058dcd7b90dbe7da530f819b3829fbac14e5682f1a77"
    },
    {
      "key": "0650acc",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_intro",
      "sourceText": "Найдите теплую одежду и снаряжение для походов.",
      "sourceEnText": "Find warm clothing and mountain gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_0650acc.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3265,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:05Z",
      "textHash": "e08cdc4a3e47493026534f7ae8cb35cd6d3a0a7c97a8e56adf4d645f23fb7d9d"
    },
    {
      "key": "06b15bb",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "Ваше горное снаряжение готово. Последняя попытка добраться до вершины.",
      "sourceEnText": "You have your mountain gear. One last effort to reach the summit.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_06b15bb.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 5303,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:49Z",
      "textHash": "1dfad0583a0a0168a3eff147e4fc3b2002ac5f774b5519bcef6136c4117ea6bd"
    },
    {
      "key": "06b3363",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base2",
      "sourceText": "У вас нет перчаток!",
      "sourceEnText": "You don't have any gloves!",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_06b3363.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 1541,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:03:34Z",
      "textHash": "cb42d0ce73db8feb9c8fde4b8e28e10ce818dde0b6369389adc4e282b8d979c3"
    },
    {
      "key": "06d9f34",
      "nodeTitle": "npc_base3",
      "sourceText": "Для ходьбы по ледниковому льду нам необходимо специальное снаряжение.",
      "sourceEnText": "To walk on glacier ice, we need special gear.",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_06d9f34.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 3605,
      "updatedAt": "2026-03-15T12:40:04Z",
      "textHash": "440ffb2a713cf774603f271bdbe26628a3f81dd0527510ea3c37ab2311f75b67"
    },
    {
      "key": "06f9a2a",
      "nodeTitle": "question_alps",
      "sourceText": "В каком горном массиве расположен Монблан?",
      "sourceEnText": "In which mountain range is Mont Blanc located?",
      "audioFile": "fr_08_06f9a2a.mp3",
      "voiceProfile": "felix",
      "actorId": "Default",
      "durationMs": 2847,
      "updatedAt": "2026-08-25T00:04:06Z",
      "textHash": "868edaa129e00e0ee897cebe5a3b273e56646dcda39596dbbe8c4104519ed7d8"
